<body>
<hr/>
<p>
SetClientPref(1,4,1)
</p>
<p>
Test ID 101 eval before define (ApplyFunction)
</p>
<p>
<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <mrow>
    <mi>f</mi>
    <mo>&#x2061;</mo>
    <mfenced open="(" close=")">
      <mn>5</mn>
    </mfenced>
  </mrow>
</math>

</p>
<p>
Test ID 101 eval before define (InvisibleTimes)
</p>
